  <item>
    <title>EP07 拿什么拯救你，我的月经 [女性主义]+[好好活着]</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67591db0bdb9877a97fcf922</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67591db0bdb9877a97fcf922</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Dec 2024 05:21:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：🍑@桃子要发财</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：🍑@桃子要发财</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：🍑@桃子要发财</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：I AM WOMAN by Emme Meli</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Revolution by 路灰气球</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好，欢迎收听卧轨希声电台的第7期节目。本期节目是🍑对于月经用品（卫生巾、棉条、月经杯）的研究分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> &nbsp;研究结论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> </span><strong><span>安全性能对比</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 卫生巾</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href="https://obgyn.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/1471-0528.17668" data-url="https://obgyn.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/1471-0528.17668"><span>卫生巾毒性研究</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 棉条</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.safecosmetics.org/resources/health-science/menstrual-care-products/#:~:text=Think%20tampons%20and%20pads%20are,and%20mystery%20%E2%80%9Cfragrance%E2%80%9D%20ingredients" data-url="https://www.safecosmetics.org/resources/health-science/menstrual-care-products/#:~:text=Think%20tampons%20and%20pads%20are,and%20mystery%20%E2%80%9Cfragrance%E2%80%9D%20ingredients"><span>二恶英</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.cnn.com/2024/07/11/health/tampons-lead-arsenic-plastics-wellness/index.html#:~:text=Past%20research%20has%20found%20tampons,fragrances%20from%20many%20consumer%20products" data-url="https://www.cnn.com/2024/07/11/health/tampons-lead-arsenic-plastics-wellness/index.html#:~:text=Past%20research%20has%20found%20tampons,fragrances%20from%20many%20consumer%20products"><span>棉条毒性研究</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a> 月经杯</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.nytimes.com/wirecutter/blog/forever-chemicals-in-period-incontinence-products/" data-url="https://www.nytimes.com/wirecutter/blog/forever-chemicals-in-period-incontinence-products/"><span>月经杯与PFAS</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a> </span><strong><span>经济成本对比</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 卫生巾</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwy153ze4yno/simp" data-url="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwy153ze4yno/simp"><span>卫生巾增值税</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1263">21:03</a> 棉条</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 月经杯 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> </span><strong><span>环境污染对比</span></strong><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1319">21:59</a> 卫生巾</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> 棉条</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 月经杯</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> </span><strong><span>关于月经杯的研究&nbsp;</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkUVX5kdIj6QQIjdblLEIfI1tjDH.m4a" length="29332855" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:29:48</itunes:duration>
