    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：🐑 @青草吃小羊</span></p><span></span><p><span>受访人：Susan&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：🍑@桃子要发财 &nbsp;+ 🐑 @青草吃小羊&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：🍑@桃子要发财 &nbsp;+ &nbsp;🐑 @青草吃小羊</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐指导：🧊@等等大兵哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：人生海海 by五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：人生海海 by五月天</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听 [人生海海] 系列的第一期节目。这一系列旨在通过单人专访探索人生的无限可能性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> Susan自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 如何进入卡塔尔航空工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 在外国做空姐的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a> 润新西兰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a> 峰回路转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2668">44:28</a> 未来规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3123">52:03</a> 润学经验分享&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎在评论区与我们多多交流，畅所欲言，也欢迎在小宇宙、苹果播客搜索《卧轨希声》关注订阅，我们下期再见~</span></p>]]></description>
